<title>USA: Novellus Systems Inc Q1 net falls.</title>
<headline>Novellus Systems Inc Q1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif.</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>			    Mar 29, 1997  Mar 31, 1996</p>
<p> Net Sales		    $101,628    $115,284</p>
<p> Cost of Sales		  45,732	48,419</p>
<p>   Gross Profit		 55,896	66,865</p>
<p>Operating Expenses</p>
<p>  R &amp; D			   16,842	12,303</p>
<p>  SG &amp; A			  17,531	17,205</p>
<p> Total Operating Expenses   34,373	29,508</p>
<p> Income from Operations     21,523	37,357</p>
<p> Interest Income, Net	  2,133	 1,888</p>
<p> Income before Taxes	  23,656	39,245</p>
<p> Provision for Income Taxes  8,043	13,736</p>
<p> Net Income		     15,613	25,509</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share	   0.91	  1.55</p>
<p>Shares Used in Per Share</p>
<p>  Calculations		  17,137	16,508</p>
<p>(in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
